  "description": "<h3 data-path-to-node=\"2\"><b data-path-to-node=\"2\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Handcrafted Bamboo &amp; Rattan Pendant Light: Organic Warmth for Contemporary Spaces</b></h3>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"3\">As interior design trends shift towards natural materials, biophilic aesthetics, and sustainable home decor, woven lighting fixtures have become high-demand statement pieces across global markets. We are proud to introduce our <b data-path-to-node=\"3\" data-index-in-node=\"227\">Handcrafted Bamboo &amp; Rattan Pendant Light</b>, a stunning light fixture designed to bring organic warmth, artistic elegance, and rustic sophistication to any interior setting.</p>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"3\"><img loading=\"lazy\" class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-1489\" src=\"https://vietcraft.vn/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/VH24031-pendant-light-made-of-bamboo-rattan-from-vietnam.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"1080\" height=\"1080\" /></p>\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"5\"><b data-path-to-node=\"5\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Key Highlights &amp; Product Features</b></h3>\n<h4 data-path-to-node=\"6\"><b data-path-to-node=\"6\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">1. 100% Eco-Friendly &amp; Sustainable Materials</b></h4>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"7\">Crafted from natural, rapidly renewable bamboo and rattan, this pendant light offers a clean, eco-conscious alternative to industrial plastic and metal fixtures. Each piece is treated naturally without harsh chemicals, retaining its light organic hue while offering exceptional durability and lightweight structure.</p>\n<h4 data-path-to-node=\"8\"><b data-path-to-node=\"8\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">2. Artisanal Weaving &amp; Sculptural Design</b></h4>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"9\">Every lamp shade is meticulously hand-woven by master Vietnamese artisans using traditional basketry techniques. Key design details include:</p>\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"10\">\n<li>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"10,0,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"10,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Sculptural Wavy Brim Silhouette:</b> The wide, fluted shade features dynamic, organic curves that cast captivating light-and-shadow patterns across room surfaces when illuminated.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"10,1,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"10,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Intricate Weave Pattern:</b> The tightly woven neck transitions into a wider open weave, creating a harmonious balance between structure and soft ambient light distribution.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"10,2,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"10,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Warm Ambient Atmosphere:</b> Perfect for housing warm LED filament bulbs to create a cozy, inviting ambiance in dining areas, living rooms, and hospitality venues.</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h4 data-path-to-node=\"11\"><b data-path-to-node=\"11\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">3. Versatile Commercial &amp; Residential Application</b></h4>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"12\">This versatile pendant light fits seamlessly into modern Scandinavian, Bohemian, Japandi, coastal, and eco-luxury design projects. It is an ideal addition for home decor importers, lighting wholesalers, resort developers, cafe owners, and hospitality interior design firms.</p>\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"14\"><b data-path-to-node=\"14\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Sustainable Impact: Empowering Communities &amp; Preserving Heritage</b></h3>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"15\">By sourcing our handcrafted rattan and bamboo lighting fixtures, your brand actively supports sustainable development and community growth:</p>\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"16\">\n<li>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"16,0,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"16,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Job Creation for Rural Farmers &amp; Artisans:</b> Bamboo and rattan harvesting and weaving provide consistent employment and fair wages for local farmers and skilled craftspeople in traditional Vietnamese craft villages.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"16,1,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"16,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Preserving Traditional Craftsmanship:</b> Vietnam has a centuries-old heritage of natural fiber weaving. Bringing these artisanal lamps to global markets helps preserve cultural heritage and keep traditional craft communities thriving for future generations.</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"18\"><b data-path-to-node=\"18\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">OEM / ODM &amp; Custom Manufacturing Solutions</b></h3>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"19\">We offer comprehensive custom manufacturing capabilities to help you meet your specific market demands:</p>\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"20\">\n<li>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"20,0,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"20,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Custom Colors &amp; Stains:</b> Available in natural light beige, vintage brown, smoked black, or custom lacquer finishes to fit your brand’s palette.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"20,1,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"20,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Custom Dimensions:</b> We can scale shade diameters and heights according to project or catalog specifications.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"20,2,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"20,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Electrical Components &amp; Certification Compliance:</b> Shades can be supplied individually or with pre-wired cord sets (E26/E27 sockets, ceiling roses, and cord lengths) compliant with international safety standards (CE, UL, RoHS, SAA).</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"20,3,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"20,3,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Export &amp; E-Commerce Packaging:</b> Robust mail-order packaging, nested stacking options for optimized container loading, barcode labeling, and custom branding boxes.</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"22\"><b data-path-to-node=\"22\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Partner with Us Today</b></h3>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"23\">Illuminate your portfolio with authentic, eco-friendly lighting solutions from Vietnam.</p>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"24\">📩 <b data-path-to-node=\"24\" data-index-in-node=\"3\">Contact Us Today</b> to request product catalogs, sample units, or competitive FOB wholesale quotations!</p>",
